Subject: [PATCH] Make rate packages clickable and pre-fill Reserve Now form
 from selection

- RatesSection: each package card (A, B, C, D-E) is now clickable for
  every villa. The clicked package turns blue and stays selected per
  villa (a checkmark badge shows which one is active).
- Reserve This Villa now publishes the chosen villa + package to the
  Reserve Now form (via a small event/sessionStorage bridge in
  src/app/lib/reserveSelection.ts) and smooth-scrolls to #booking.
- BookingCTA: picks up that selection on mount/event and pre-fills the
  Selected Villa and Guests fields so the estimated rate lands back on
  the same package the guest clicked.
